  'poolvsHODL' already CONTAINS all retained LP fees, so it must not be added to a
  separate fee column (an earlier draft of this table did exactly that and was wrong).
  It falls as gamma rises for TWO reasons that must be separated: (1) deterred
  sandwiches stop paying 3 legs of LP fee - that is the mechanism working, and (2) the
  staleness we cause.  PART 6b removes reason (1) entirely.

