  further retraced tick is free, so the attacker's optimal sandwich grows to the point
  where the cap binds.  Read 'sw esc' and 'sw keep' as the cap tightens.

  FIX B - deadband: the first D ticks of extension each block create NO budget.
  Intent: the corrective arb's extension stops authorising a tax on honest flow.
scenario                          staleT0  hon chg  hon bps  arb-cau  sw esc  sw keep arb kill arb short  fee$/blk
gamma=1, deadband=0 ticks          11.56t    44.6%    3.79b    38.0%   24.6%     1.6%     0.0%     26.3%     15.43
gamma=1, deadband=2 ticks          11.41t    38.9%    3.28b    35.4%   26.7%     1.7%     0.0%     25.2%     14.17
gamma=1, deadband=5 ticks          11.17t    31.3%    2.67b    32.4%   28.2%     1.7%     0.0%     23.2%     12.56
